<TD WIDTH="5%" VALIGN="top" ALIGN="left">(5)(a)</TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:8pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">Based on a post-transaction equity value of New Bridger of approximately $1,125.7&nbsp;million, calculated by
multiplying (a)&nbsp;the sum of (i)&nbsp;39,346,615 shares of New Bridger Common Stock to be issued at the Closing to the Existing Bridger Equityholders at the Closing based on the Per Share Common Stock Consideration, (ii)&nbsp;assuming Series C
Shareholders exercise their conversion rights at a conversion price of $11.00 per share at the Closing, 30,103,074 shares of New Bridger Common Stock issuable in respect of the New Bridger Series&nbsp;A Preferred Shares at Closing, and
(iii)&nbsp;8,625,000 shares of JCIC Class&nbsp;B Ordinary Shares and, assuming no redemptions by the public shareholders, 34,500,000 public shares of JCIC Class&nbsp;A Ordinary Shares convertible into shares of New Bridger Common Stock on a
one-to-one basis upon the Closing, by (b)&nbsp;$10.00. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:8pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
