scenario column plus (i)&nbsp;a total cash exercise price of approximately $11.5&nbsp;million (or $11.50 per share) from the full exercise of 1,000,000 shares of the JCIC Warrants pursuant to the repayment of the convertible promissory note in the
no redemption scenario, 25% redemption scenario, the 50% redemption scenario and the 75% redemption scenario or (ii)&nbsp;no cash proceeds in connection with the 100,000 shares of New Bridger Common Stock issuable pursuant to the repayment of the
convertible promissory note in the maximum redemption scenario. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
