of fees and expenses for legal counsel, accounting advisors, external auditors and financial advisors incurred by JCIC in connection with the Transactions prior to Closing, but excluding any deferred underwriting fees, are less than $6,500,000. If
the actual facts are different from these assumptions, the percentage ownership retained by the current JCIC shareholders in New Bridger will be different. </P> <P STYLE="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
