warranties and <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">pre-Closing</FONT> covenants in the Merger Agreement; </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
