company shares to a potential acquiror or delay or prevent changes in control or changes in our management without the consent of the New Bridger Board. The provisions in the combined
company&#146;s charter documents will include the following: </P> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
