ended September&nbsp;30, 2022 and the historical audited financial statements of JCIC for the year ended December&nbsp;31, 2021; </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
