Bridger&#146;s bylaws, each of which will occur immediately prior to the Effective Time and the Closing of the Business Combination; </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
