<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">Reflects the estimated stock-based compensation expense associated with the vesting of the New Award Grants
expected to be granted, which is in a number of shares based on approximately 10% of the New Bridger Common Stock expected to be outstanding immediately after the Closing, after taking into account redemptions by JCIC&#146;s public shareholders, to
executives and employees of Bridger with service and performance vesting conditions as the service condition is deemed to be satisfied. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The adjustments related to Other Financing and Reorganization Events included in the unaudited pro forma combined statement of operations for
the year ended December 31, 2021 were as follows: </P> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
<TR style = "page-break-inside:avoid">
