Bridger incentive units that remained unvested as of September&nbsp;30, 2022. These Bridger incentive units were granted with service and performance vesting conditions, all of which deemed to be satisfied at the Closing. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
