Agreement shall be true and correct other than with respect to de minimis inaccuracies, as of the Closing Date, as though then made. </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
