<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">Represented loss on the disposal or obsolescence of aging aircraft. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
