<TD WIDTH="4%" VALIGN="top" ALIGN="left">iii)</TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">Represents one time costs associated with legal fees for infrequent or unusual transactions that were not
capitalizable per GAAP. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
