subsidiary of publicly traded JPMorgan Chase &amp; Co., the board of directors and chief executive officer of which are identified in JPMorgan Chase &amp; Co.&#146;s filings with the SEC. The address for JPMorgan Chase Funding Inc. is 383 Madison
