to Bridger Element&#146;s equityholders in connection with the Closing. The general partner of Bear Creek LLLP is BCGP-2016, LLC (&#147;Bear Creek GP&#148;). Joseph H. M. Roddy is the manager of Bear Creek GP. Joseph H. M. Roddy may be deemed to
beneficially own the securities held directly or indirectly by Bear Creek LLLP and Bear Creek GP. The address for Bear Creek LLLP, Bear Creek GP, and Joseph H. M. Roddy is 1200 17th Street, Suite 970, Denver, Colorado 80202. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
