adjusted) for any 20 trading days within a <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">30-trading</FONT> day period ending three trading days before the Company sends the notice of redemption to the warrant holders. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
 <p STYLE="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt ; font-size:8pt">&nbsp;</P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="center">F-42 </P>

