 <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">&#147;<U><FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">COVID-19</FONT></U>&#148; means <FONT
STYLE="white-space:nowrap">SARS-CoV-2</FONT> or <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">COVID-19,</FONT> and any evolutions thereof or any other epidemics, pandemics or disease outbreaks. </P>
