<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">&#147;<U>New PubCo Series A Preferred Stock</U>&#148; means the Series A preferred stock of New PubCo. </P>
