<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">&#147;<U>Securities Laws</U>&#148; means the securities laws of any state, federal or foreign entity and the rules and regulations promulgated
