<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">&#147;<U>Software</U>&#148; means all: (a)&nbsp;software or computer programs of any type, including all software implementations of
