<U>Section</U><U></U><U>&nbsp;13.01(c)</U>. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">&#147;<U>Termination Date</U>&#148; has the meaning specified in
