<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4%; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">(a) Purchaser has filed in a timely manner all required registration statements, reports, schedules, forms, statements and
other documents required to be filed by it with the SEC since January&nbsp;25, 2021 (collectively, as they have been amended since the time of their filing and including all exhibits thereto, the &#147;<U>SEC Reports</U>&#148;). None of the SEC
Reports, as of their respective dates (or if amended or superseded by a filing prior to the date of this Agreement or the Closing Date, then on the date of such filing), contained any </P>
 <p STYLE="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt ; font-size:8pt">&nbsp;</P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="center">A-45 </P>

