the Company&#146;s public stockholders having the right to exchange their Company Stock for cash, securities or other property. </P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">&#147;<B><I>Holders</I></B>&#148; shall mean the Existing Holders and the New Holders and any person or entity who hereafter becomes a party
to this Agreement pursuant to <U>Section</U><U></U><U>&nbsp;5.2</U>. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">&#147;<B><I>Holder Indemnified Parties</I></B>&#148; shall have the
