shall mean a person or entity to whom a Holder of Registrable Securities is permitted to transfer such Registrable Securities prior to the expiration of the Blackstone Holder <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">Lock-Up</FONT> Period, Founder Shares <FONT
STYLE="white-space:nowrap">Lock-Up</FONT> Period, the New Holder <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">Lock-Up</FONT> Period and the Sponsor Private Placement Warrants <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">Lock-Up</FONT> Period, as the case may be, under the
