<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">&#147;<B><I>Registrable Security</I></B>&#148; shall mean (a)&nbsp;shares of Company Stock issued upon the conversion of the Founder Shares in
connection with the Transactions, (b)&nbsp;the warrants of the Company into which the Sponsor Private Placement Warrants are converted in connection with the Transactions (including the shares of Company Stock
