<FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">pre-</FONT> or <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">after-tax</FONT> income (before or after allocation of corporate overhead and bonus), income from continuing operations, operating income (before or after taxes), <FONT
STYLE="white-space:nowrap">non-interest</FONT> income, net income after cost of capital, net interest income, fee income and income measures excluding the impact of acquisitions and dispositions); </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
