<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">cash flow measures (including, but not limited to, cash flow (before or after dividends), operating cash flow,
free cash flow, discounted cash flow, cash flow return on investment and cash flow in excess of cost of capital); </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
