such greater percentage as designated by the Committee) of the Fair Market Value of a Share on the Offering Date or (ii)&nbsp;eighty-five percent (85%) (or such greater percentage as designated by the Committee) of the Fair Market Value of a Share
on the Purchase Date; provided that the Purchase Price per Share will in no event be less than the par value of the Shares. </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
