<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">Wildfire Merger Sub I will merge with and into Blocker whereby Blocker will be the surviving entity of the
merger (the &#147;<U>First Merger</U>&#148;) and will become a subsidiary of New PubCo following the First Merger, following which Wildfire GP Sub IV will be the general partner of the surviving entity; </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
