<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">On the basis of the foregoing, it is our opinion that (i)&nbsp;the Transactions are fair, from a financial point of view, to JCIC and (ii)&nbsp;the Company
has a fair market value equal to at least eighty percent (80%) of the balance of funds in JCIC&#146;s Trust Account (excluding deferred underwriting commissions and taxes payable). </P>
