of this Plan of Merger. The Merging Company has granted no fixed or floating security interests that are outstanding as at the date of this Plan of Merger. </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
